red with his heavy riding glove across the face.\\n\\n\u201cThere was nothing in this act that especially caught my attention, for I had seen ordinary people beaten more often than dogs. But the other man, also angry, struck the servant in the same way with his arm. The brothers looked and carried themselves so exactly alike that I then realized for the first time that they were twins.\\n\\n\u201cFrom the moment we got down at the outer gate\u2014which was locked, and which one brother opened to let us in and then locked again\u2014I had heard cries coming from an upper room.\"}"
