have a grandfather, and far more than that to have a family Ghost.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I don\u2019t think I would like America.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I suppose that is because we have no ruins or curiosities,\u2019 said Virginia sarcastically.\\n\\n\u2018No ruins! No curiosities!\u2019 replied the Ghost. \u2018You have your navy and your manners.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Good evening. I shall go and ask Papa to give the twins an extra week of holiday.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Please don\u2019t go, Miss Virginia,\u2019 he cried. \u2018I am so lonely and unhappy, and I truly do not know what to do. I want to go to sleep, but I cannot.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018That is quite absurd. You only have to go to bed and blow out the candle.\u2019\"}"
