uld be learned. By twelve o\u2019clock the circular center had greatly decreased in size, and by seven P.M. I lost sight of it altogether, as the balloon passed over the western edge of the ice and drifted rapidly toward the equator.\\n\\n\u201cApril 8th. I found a noticeable decrease in the earth\u2019s apparent diameter, along with a considerable change in its general color and appearance.\"}"
