          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"81ea6a4f5b46d8b84df3f690\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u2018Starve you to death? Oh, Mr. Ghost\u2014I mean Sir Simon\u2014are you hungry? I have a sandwich in my case. Would you care for it?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018No, thank you; I never eat anything now. Still, it is very kind of you, and you are far nicer than the rest of your dreadful, rude, vulgar, dishonest family.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Stop!\u2019 cried Virginia, stamping her foot. \u2018It is you who are rude, horrid, and vulgar; and as for dishonesty, you know perfectly well that you stole the paints from my box to touch up that absurd blood-stain in the library. First you took all my reds, vermilion included, so that I could paint no more sunsets; then you took the emerald-green and chrome-yellow; and at last I had nothing remaining except indigo and Chinese white, and could only paint moonlight scenes, which are always depressing to see and not at all easy to paint. I never told on you, although I was very annoyed, and the whole affair was utterly ridiculous; for who ever heard of emerald-green blood?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Well, really,\u2019 said the Ghost, rather humbly, \u2018what else could I do? It is very difficult nowadays to obtain real blood, and since your brother started it all with his Paragon Detergent, I saw no reason at all why I should not use your paints. As for the colour, that is always a question of taste: the Cantervilles have blue blood, for example\u2014the very bluest in England\u2014but I know that you Americans do not care for such things.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018You know nothing whatever about it, and the best thing for you is to emigrate and educate your mind. My father would be only too pleased to give you a free passage, and though there is a heavy duty on spirits of every sort, there will be no trouble at the Custom House, since the officers are all Democrats. Once you are in New York, you are certain to be a great success. I know plenty of people there who would give a hundred thousand dollars for a grandfather, and far more than that for a family Ghost.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I do not think I should like America.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I suppose that is because we have no ruins or curiosities,\u2019 said Virginia sarcastically.\\n\\n\u2018No ruins! no curiosities!\u2019 replied the Ghost. \u2018You have your navy and your manners.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Good evening. I shall go and ask papa to give the twins another week of holiday.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Please do not go, Miss Virginia,\u2019 he cried. \u2018I am so lonely and unhappy, and I truly do not know what to do. I want to go to sleep, but I cannot.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018That is quite absurd! You need only go to bed and blow out the candle.\u2019\"}"
