d what he meant. He told me. He said it openly, before everyone. It was horrible! Why is your friendship so destructive to young men? There was that unfortunate boy in the Guards who killed himself. You were his close friend. There was Sir Henry Ashton, who had to leave England with his name disgraced.\"}"
