es able to bear the strain. But this isn\u2019t London talk. Where do you suppose I\u2019m bound for?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cTo the office?\u201d I said, since he was walking that way.\\n\\n\u201cThe next thing to it,\u201d Wemmick replied. \u201cI\u2019m going to Newgate. We\u2019re engaged in a banker\u2019s-parcel case at present, and I\u2019ve been down the road to take a look at the scene of action, and must now have a word or two with our client.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDid your client do the robbery?\u201d I asked.\\n\\n\u201cBless your soul and body, no,\u201d Wemmick answered, very dryly. \u201cBut he\u2019s charged with it. You or I might be charged with it too. Either of us might be accused of it, you know.\u201d\"}"
