s the box that had contained the aconitine.\\n\\nLord Arthur started, and a faint flush rose in his cheeks. He had almost completely forgotten what he had done, and it struck him as a strange coincidence that Sybil, for whose sake he had endured all that terrible anxiety, should be the first to remind him of it.\\n\\n\u2018Of course you may have it, Sybil. I gave it to poor Lady Clem myself.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Oh, thank you, Arthur; and may I have the bonbon as well? I had no idea Lady Clementina liked sweets. I thought she was much too intellectual.\u2019\\n\\nLord Arthur turned deathly pale, and a dreadful thought passed through his mind.\"}"
