eavens, Lady Clem!\u2019 cried Lord Arthur, seizing her hand, \u2018you must do no such thing. It is a homoeopathic remedy, and if you take it when you have no heartburn, it may do you endless harm. Wait until you have an attack, and then take it. You will be amazed by the result.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I should like to take it at once,\u2019 said Lady Clementina, raising the small transparent capsule, with its floating bubble of liquid aconitine, to the light. \u2018I am sure it is delicious. The truth is, though I detest doctors, I adore medicines. Still, I shall keep it for my next attack.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018And when will that be?\u2019 Lord Arthur asked eagerly.\"}"
