nto my possession. The place where we found the scarab\u00e6us was on the mainland coast, about a mile east of the island and only a short distance above the high-water mark. When I took hold of it, it gave me a sharp bite, making me drop it. Jupiter, with his usual caution, before taking hold of the insect, which had flown toward him, looked around for a leaf or something similar with which to grasp it.\"}"
