und his neck\u2014and was dismissed. Would you believe that cured them? It certainly did. Any ceremony will cure if the patient\u2019s faith in it is strong enough. Near Astolat stood a chapel where the Virgin had once appeared to a girl who herded geese there\u2014or so the girl herself said. They built the chapel on that spot and hung in it a picture showing the event, a picture you might think dangerous for a sick person even to approach. Yet thousands of the lame and ill came every year, prayed before it, and departed healthy and whole; even the healthy could look upon it and survive.\"}"
