e.\\n\\n\u201cI never imagined,\u201d Estella said, \u201cthat in saying goodbye to this place, I would be saying goodbye to you. I am very glad that I am.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cGlad to part again, Estella? To me, parting is painful. The memory of our last parting has always been sad and painful to me.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cBut you said to me,\u201d Estella returned, very earnestly, \u201c\u2018God bless you, God forgive you!\u2019 And if you could say that to me then, you will not hesitate to say it now\u2014now, when suffering has been stronger than every other lesson, and has taught me to understand what your heart once was. I have been bent and broken, but\u2014I hope\u2014into a better form.\u201d\"}"
