tents scattered on the floor beside it. The victims must have been seated with their backs to the window; and, judging by the interval between the beast\u2019s entrance and their screams, they probably did not notice it at once. The shutter\u2019s closing would naturally have been blamed on the wind.\\n\\nAs the sailor looked in, the enormous animal had seized Madame L\u2019Espanaye by her hair, loose because she had been combing it, and was waving the razor around her face in imitation of a barber\u2019s movements.\"}"
