h his rooms to the distant region called the Circumference of Truth. There Monseigneur turned and came back, and in time had himself shut within his sanctuary by the chocolate sprites, and was seen no more.\\n\\nThe performance over, the flutter in the air rose into a small storm, and the precious little bells rang down the stairs. Soon only one person remained of the whole crowd, and he, carrying his hat beneath his arm and his snuff-box in his hand, moved slowly among the mirrors toward the exit.\\n\\n\u201cI consign you,\u201d said this person, pausing at the last door and turning toward the sanctuary, \u201cto the Devil!\u201d\\n\\nWith that, he flicked the snuff from his fingers as though shaking dust from his feet, and quietly went downstairs.\"}"
