n that Provis had not been there.\\n\\n\u201cI dare say you are wondering about me, Mr. Pip; indeed, I can see that you are. But it is very strange! You will hardly believe what I am going to tell you. I could hardly believe it myself, if you had told me.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cIndeed?\u201d I said.\\n\\n\u201cNo, indeed. Mr. Pip, do you remember, long ago, a certain Christmas Day, when you were a small child and I dined at Gargery\u2019s, and some soldiers came to the door to have a pair of handcuffs repaired?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI remember it very well.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd do you remember that there was a chase after two convicts, that we joined it, that Gargery carried you on his back, that I led the way, and that you followed me as well as you could?\u201d\"}"
