y can cure if the patient has enough faith in it. Near Astolat stood a chapel where the Virgin had once appeared to a girl who herded geese there\u2014the girl said so herself. They built the chapel on that spot and hung in it a picture showing the event, a picture you might think dangerous for a sick person even to approach. Yet thousands of lame and sick people came every year, prayed before it, and went away healthy and sound; even healthy people could look at it and survive.\"}"
