dered into the ruined chancel of the old abbey. The Duchess sat on a fallen pillar, while her husband lay at her feet, smoking a cigarette and gazing up into her lovely eyes. Suddenly he tossed away his cigarette, took her hand, and said, \u2018Virginia, a wife should have no secrets from her husband.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Dear Cecil! I have no secrets from you.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Yes, you do,\u2019 he replied with a smile. \u2018You have never told me what happened to you when you were shut up with the ghost.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I have never told anyone, Cecil,\u2019 Virginia said seriously.\"}"
