          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"ca30fb89e52bad776f11a3bc\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u201cWell, Jup,\u201d I said, \u201cwhat is wrong now?\u2014how is your master?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, to tell de troof, him aint quite so berry well as he mought be.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNot well! I am sincerely sorry to hear it. What does he complain of?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDar! dat\u2019s de ting!\u2014him neber \u2019plain of notin\u2019\u2014but for all dat him berry sick.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cVery sick, Jupiter!\u2014why did you not tell me that immediately? Is he kept in bed?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, dat he aint!\u2014he aint \u2019fin\u2019d nowhar\u2014dat\u2019s just whar de shoe pinch\u2014my mind got to be berry hebby \u2019bout poor Massa Will.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cJupiter, I wish to know what you mean. You say your master is ill. Has he not told you what is the matter with him?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, \u2019taint no use gittin\u2019 mad \u2019bout it\u2014Massa Will say noffin at all aint de matter wid him\u2014but den what make him walk about dis way, wid he head down and he shoulders up, and white as a gose? And den he keep a cipher all de time\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a what, Jupiter?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a cipher wid figgurs on de slate\u2014de queerest figgurs I ebber see. Ise beginning to git skeered, I tell you. Hab to keep a mighty close eye \u2019pon him \u2019noovers. Todder day he slipped away \u2019fore sun-up and was gone all de blessed day. I had a big stick cut ready to gib him a deuced good beating when he come back\u2014but Ise sich a fool dat I hadn\u2019t de heart arter all\u2014he look so berry poorly.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cEh?\u2014what?\u2014ah yes!\u2014on the whole, I think you had better not be too hard upon the poor fellow\u2014do not flog him, Jupiter\u2014he can scarcely bear it\u2014but can you form no notion what has caused this illness, or rather this alteration in conduct? Has anything disagreeable occurred since I saw you?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, massa, dere aint bin noffin onpleasant since den\u2014\u2018twas \u2019fore den I\u2019m feared\u2014\u2018twas de berry day you was dare.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHow? What do you mean?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, I means de bug\u2014dar now.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe what?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDe bug,\u2014I\u2019m berry sartain Massa Will got bit somewhere \u2019bout de head by dat goole-bug.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd what reason have you, Jupiter, for such a belief?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cClaws enough, massa, and mouff too. I nebber see sich a deuced bug\u2014he kick and bite ebery ting dat come near him. Massa Will cotch him fuss, but had to let him go \u2019gin mighty quick, I tell you\u2014den was when he must ha\u2019 got de bite. I didn\u2019t like de look ob de bug\u2019s mouff myself, no how, so I wouldn\u2019t take hold ob him wid my finger, but cotch him wid a piece ob paper I found.\u201d\"}"
