r watches and things, but you always take off your hat and speak politely. Nobody is as polite as robbers\u2014you\u2019ll see that in any book. Then the women start loving you, and after they\u2019ve been in the cave for a week or two, they stop crying, and after that you couldn\u2019t make them leave. If you drove them out, they\u2019d turn right around and come back. That\u2019s how it is in all the books.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, that\u2019s really great, Tom. I think it\u2019s better than being a pirate.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, it\u2019s better in some ways, because it\u2019s close to home, and circuses, and all that.\u201d\\n\\nBy this time everything was ready, and the boys went into the hole, with Tom leading. They worked their way to the far end of the tunnel, tied their spliced kite strings fast, and went on.\"}"
