Lady Windermere; it is the one subject Arthur does not like people joking about. I assure you, he takes it quite seriously.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018You don\u2019t mean he believes in it, Sybil?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Ask him, Lady Windermere\u2014here he is\u2019; and Lord Arthur came up through the garden carrying a large bunch of yellow roses, with his two children dancing around him.\\n\\n\u2018Lord Arthur?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Yes, Lady Windermere.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018You don\u2019t mean to say you believe in palmistry?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Of course I do,\u2019 said the young man, smiling.\\n\\n\u2018But why?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Because I owe all the happiness of my life to it,\u2019 he murmured, sinking into a wicker chair.\"}"
